    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Emily",
      "key": "summer_Sun6",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Hi, @! We've become decent friends, haven't we?$h#$e#That's fine with me. You're a cool guy.^I'm glad.$h",
      "translation": "Ahoj, @! Vzniklo mezi námi docela pěkné přátelství, že?$h#$e#To mi vyhovuje. Jsi fajn kluk.^Mám radost.$h",
      "sourceSHA256": "9ad92c0c524aad1d7770be27ffe7a731447d07c2bf55e4bd5705ada05179ab21",
